c_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQwXqrChMf-reODqleXT2cBUnIx6quX-S12a6iiiTuoNA&oe=6AEDE88B"}, "display_name": "POLYBLOCS", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Research-Creation Project: The Polyblocs construction game, integrated into a virtual environment, enables the rapid creation of prototypes, offering a playful and participatory way to shape architectural concepts. The Polyblocs tool provides practitioners with a space for freedom and agency often lacking in conventional architectural design solutions, fostering spontaneous expression in the previsualization process.\n\n", "short_description": "The Polyblocs construction game, integrated into a virtual environment, enables rapid prototyping, offering a playful, participatory approach to architectural design while fostering freedom and spontaneity in previsualization.\n\n\n"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "cov1.png", "id": "2351174138582301", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974759_2351174141915634_2969451169120856586_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=qrpOFacnFwIQ7kNvwGT602B&_nc_oc=AdpDgGG0Ef55Slt2bX9K3chb7O_zL1HedQ3XAYBjFrzjjl5N03e3g4PqGNyvsuZxb38&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSagvkSMzR1OeAhr2GCTMUJvqyS6sPLFw__-Lo3kQG4wg&oe=6AEDDC09"}, {"file_name": "cov4.png", "id": "1531289950891358", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75485579_1531289954224691_4417623240716955788_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=s24D7d2ta8kQ7kNvwE7ZoUF&_nc_oc=AdqSQ5oIAKqMXufPHU5sWNJeuub_dvtblrY2AT5THDl--iVybXmHfMUGN_0m3ykHaO8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTpml8bwD0LdUEzwxN9wXJmyy0j7w_EtB-CB3oOlBMx0g&oe=6AEDDA3D"}, {"file_name": "banner pb 1440 1440 v2.png", "id": "1498865307473211", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.577